            "description": {
              "content": "Performs a real-time check of the VIN against national police databases of stolen vehicles (Czech Republic, Hungary, Lithuania, Romania, Slovenia, Slovakia) and Vincario's own database. The control sum is computed from `{VIN}|stolencheck|{apikey}|{secretkey}`.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
